---
title: "cancel (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_check_not_published: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_not_published --> q_check_not_canceled: results not yet published
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert: revert ResultsAlreadyPublished
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_set_canceled: isCanceled == false
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_revert: revert AlreadyCanceled
    q_set_canceled --> [*]: isCanceled = true, emit SaleCanceled
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_check_not_published
        INV-001: cancellation only allowed before results publication
        INV-002: canceled sale enables withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled for all investors
        INV-003: cancellation is irreversible
    end note
